<Vertical id="freewriteChain" title="Freewrite Chain Demo" launchable="true">

<Markdown>
## SBA Design Sprint

Three rapid brainstorming rounds. Each round auto-starts when the previous
one ends. Write continuously — don't stop to edit or second-guess. You can
review everything at the end.
</Markdown>

<!-- Round 1: always visible until it expires -->
<TimedContainer id="r1" duration="30 seconds" start="render" hideuntilstart="true"
                when="!@r1.expired">
  <Markdown>**Round 1 — The World.** Brainstorm a setting for a scenario-based assessment. What domain? What's happening? What makes it interesting?</Markdown>
  <Freewrite id="fwWorld" invisible="true" nodelete="true" counter="true" />
</TimedContainer>

<!-- Round 2: appears when round 1 expires, disappears when it expires -->
<TimedContainer id="r2" duration="30 seconds" start="render" hideuntilstart="true"
                when="@r1.expired &amp;&amp; !@r2.expired">
  <Markdown>**Round 2 — The Cast.** Who's in this world? Brainstorm characters the student might play, interact with, or advise.</Markdown>
  <Freewrite id="fwCast" invisible="true" nodelete="true" counter="true" />
</TimedContainer>

<!-- Round 3: appears when round 2 expires -->
<TimedContainer id="r3" duration="30 seconds" start="render" hideuntilstart="true"
                when="@r2.expired &amp;&amp; !@r3.expired">
  <Markdown>**Round 3 — Learning Objectives.** What should students learn or practice in this scenario? What decisions will they face?</Markdown>
  <Freewrite id="fwObjectives" invisible="true" nodelete="true" counter="true" />
</TimedContainer>

<!-- Results: shown after all three rounds -->
<Markdown when="@r3.expired">
## Your brainstorming results

**The World:**

{{text2markdown(@fwWorld.value)}}

---

**The Cast:**

{{text2markdown(@fwCast.value)}}

---

**Learning Objectives:**

{{text2markdown(@fwObjectives.value)}}
</Markdown>

</Vertical>
